{
  "_about": [
    "The flavor tagging pass's editorial table: one row per DFW cheese-type id,",
    "mapping the type into SCHEMA.md's closed vocabularies. scripts/catalog.py",
    "combines these rows with each exported creamery's made-role type links to",
    "produce data/catalog/cheeses.json — one record per creamery x type.",
    "",
    "Where data/raw/dfw_varieties.json carries a hardness/flavor profile it seeded",
    "the row; the rest is curated cheese knowledge and is meant to be edited like",
    "any override. A type ABSENT from this table produces no records: catalog.py",
    "lists absentees with their makers in queue/review_cheeses.json so untagged",
    "cheeses are always a visible worklist, never silently dropped.",
    "Trademarks are detected from ® / ™ in the type name, not stored here."
  ],
